  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A symbiat of 8th level or higher can no longer be flanked. This defense denies a rogue the ability to sneak attack the character by flanking him, unless the attacker has at least four more rogue levels than the target does.</p>\n<p>If a character already has uncanny dodge from another class, the levels from the classes that grant uncanny dodge stack to determine the minimum rogue level required to flank the character.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/symbiat#toc24\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
